(replace key terms with synonyms)\n      (b) 15 clause reordering pairs (reorder conditions without changing meaning)\n      Run 30 × 2 conditions × 3 API models (gpt-5.4, gpt-4.1, claude-sonnet-4-6) = 180 episodes.\n      Key metric: Δ_net = Δ_ambiguity - Δ_perturb (net ambiguity-specific effect).\n      [Reviewer升级] 必须在 plan_002/003 full study 之前完成——\n      如果 perturbation Δpp ≈ ambiguity Δpp，2,400 episodes 全部无效。\n      低成本验证（30 pairs + 120 episodes API）优先于高成本投入。\n      [判定标准 — 5 档]:\n      PASS: Δ_perturb < 5pp (CI含0), ratio < 0.15 → C1 因果 claim 最强形式\n      PASS+caveat: 5-10pp, ratio 0.15-0.30 → 报告 perturbation baseline, C1 写 net effect\n      CONDITIONAL: 10-15pp, ratio 0.30-0.45 → 需 Δ_net > 20pp 且显著才可发表\n      WARNING: 15-20pp, ratio 0.45-0.60 → C1 改为 \"additional violations beyond sensitivity\"\n      FAIL: > 20pp, ratio > 0.60 → 无法声称 ambiguity-specific, 需根本重新设计\n      [Power 注意]: N=120 对 10pp 差异 power ≈ 30%. 用 CI 宽度判定, 非 p-value.\n      若 CI 过宽(>15pp width), 追加 60 episodes 压窄至 <10pp width.\n      输出标准化 verdict 文件: perturbation_Δpp, ambiguity_Δpp, net_Δpp, CI, ratio, verdict.\n    priority: P0\n    gpu_budget_hours: 0\n    deps: [plan_001]\n    status: planned\n\n  # === P2: Nice to have ===\n\n  - id: plan_008\n    name: classifier_poc\n    claim: \"practical contribution\"\n    description: >\n      Binary ambiguity detector PoC: fine-tune DeBERTa-v3-large on\n      annotated clause pairs (ambiguous/unambiguous labels). Eval on\n      held-out set. Demonstrates practical applicability of findings.\n      Phase 3 from IDEA_BRIEF, scoped to PoC for EMNLP.\n    priority: P2\n    gpu_budget_hours: 8\n    deps: [plan_001]\n    status: planned\n\n# Resource summary:\n# P0 GPU: 0h (plan_003 pivoted to API — no GPU needed)\n# P1 GPU: 15h (plan_006 reliability local portion — can also go API)\n# P2 GPU: 8h (plan_008 classifier fine-tuning)\n# Total GPU: 8-23h (P2 only essential; P1 optional if API covers it)\n# API cost: ~$450-700 (1,800 plan_002 + 1,200 plan_003 via